  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">검정말을 구하러 여기저기 다녀보다가 결국 구하지 못하고<br>동네 수족관에서 물미역모스(?) 라는 식물(?)을 구해왔어요. (물고기 키우시는 분들이 많이 이용하시는데, 정확한 이름 아시면 댓글 부탁드려요)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a07f99da77420e53735dc4944636014e8a3b7754\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a07f99da77420e53735dc4944636014e8a3b7754\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>결론은..  검정말을 대체해서 실험하기에 아주 좋았답니다.<br><br>BTB용액에 날숨 불어 넣기 포함해서 <br>어제 영상 만들었는데 수업에 이용하셔도 좋을 것 같습니다.<br>저는 1시간 15분 타임랩스 -&gt; 38초(120배속)으로 찍었구요~<br>영상에 별다른 설명은 많이 안 넣었습니다~ ㅎㅎ<br><br><br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/9TjURJo2KYU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/9TjURJo2KYU</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9TjURJo2KYU\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"kakao_tv\" data-video-width=\"1280\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bZ1kum/hyOzMF0edA/ZPkjYUmqPvXaKL46SvUW7k/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"1280\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9TjURJo2KYU\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>물미역모스(?) 엽록체의 현미경 사진도 첨부합니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b5b68c2fee26595a8bfcf207c8d1b7ff14a368cf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b5b68c2fee26595a8bfcf207c8d1b7ff14a368cf\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b43035f80255fde35181c80c17eb2e6258c93cd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b43035f80255fde35181c80c17eb2e6258c93cd\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0426d89c6d6cd58bb99993c174e65c0785d872a8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0426d89c6d6cd58bb99993c174e65c0785d872a8\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><br>탈색 후 아이오딘 반응 후</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c43777d4ec03d3fc01dd39b1aa22e7ede5f8a08\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c43777d4ec03d3fc01dd39b1aa22e7ede5f8a08\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
